  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pfunda Tea Production and Collection Improvements</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Tea.Beneficiaries: 1,816 (702 women).Description: The project will enable the cooperative to increase area under production, improve management of the plantation and quality of the tea, and increase efficiency of operations through road improvement and renewal of aging equipment, resulting in increased incomes for members and improved profitability of the cooperative.</narrative>
  </description>
